committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1792130106 +0900

HoldMem: slot-keyed upsert cells (prereg v4 block U)

CellConfig(upsert=True), B=0 only and not with refresh; cells
holdmem_D0B0_upsert, holdmem_D1B0_upsert, holdmem_D1sB0_upsert and the
--cells tokens D0B0_upsert, D1B0_upsert, D1sB0_upsert. In the append-only
branch of maintain, a new delta item for a slot first retires every older
valid or unverifiable item of that slot (status invalid, history event
supersede). Requests are those of the plain B=0 cell. Tests also run
D1sB0_refresh (synth + refresh) against D1sB1_source's requests.

